    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Taking conjugate,<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Adding&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>Z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
